    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am currently missing a friend of mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fact, and I have taken note of its importance in the writing process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope that everyone involved understands that there is a possibility of misunderstanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you believe my story, and if you know of anyone who does, please feel free to contact me, as my contact information is provided below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About this game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 3D adventure horror game that progresses in a single player FPS perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend has lost track of his whereabouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious game was left on his computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to find his whereabouts, this game began to be researched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several stages and texts can be accessed from the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uneven stage compositions and scattered texts may hide unknown fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious game became a hot topic around 2019 and was discussed on the internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has passed through many hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find information hidden in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of 5 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,FPS game mode to earn scores</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,A mode in which you walk around an apartment building looking for lost items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3,A mode in which you walk through a grassy field stage and complete tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4,A mode to walk through a mysterious space and search for the next path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5,Mode to proceed to the depths of the water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions regarding video distribution.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am currently missing a friend of mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fact, and I have taken note of its importance in the writing process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope that everyone involved understands that there is a possibility of misunderstanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you believe my story, and if you know of anyone who does, please feel free to contact me, as my contact information is provided below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About this game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 3D adventure horror game that progresses in a single player FPS perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend has lost track of his whereabouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious game was left on his computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to find his whereabouts, this game began to be researched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several stages and texts can be accessed from the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uneven stage compositions and scattered texts may hide unknown fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious game became a hot topic around 2019 and was discussed on the internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has passed through many hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find information hidden in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of 5 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,FPS game mode to earn scores</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,A mode in which you walk around an apartment building looking for lost items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3,A mode in which you walk through a grassy field stage and complete tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4,A mode to walk through a mysterious space and search for the next path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5,Mode to proceed to the depths of the water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions regarding video distribution.</p>",
